BEGIN_DESC
OrbiterCrew: the astronavigator in the suit on the Moon (Brighton Beach). Try K: the suit stays on, there is no air.
W/S move, A/D turn, Q/E side step, Shift run, Space jump, K suit. Press H for the crew HUD in the cockpit view (F1).
END_DESC

